.x"},{"key":"e_1_3_4_16_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1371\/journal.pone.0036624"},{"key":"e_1_3_4_17_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1130\/G32787.1"},{"key":"e_1_3_4_18_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1080\/01621459.1985.10478210"},{"key":"e_1_3_4_19_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1007\/s10693-020-00334-9"},{"key":"e_1_3_4_20_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.2307\/3315691"},{"key":"e_1_3_4_21_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1371\/journal.pone.0100884"},{"key":"e_1_3_4_22_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1023\/A:1008363415314"},{"key":"e_1_3_4_23_1","unstructured":"Kalktawi HS (2017) Discrete Weibull regression model for count data. PhD thesis Brunel University London. URL http:\/\/bura.brunel.ac.uk\/handle\/2438\/14476"},{"key":"e_1_3_4_24_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1073\/pnas.1210722109"},{"key":"e_1_3_4_25_1","unstructured":"Lakshmanan K (2024) The 2018 Russian presidential election. SSRN. doi:10. 2139\/ssrn.4957116."},{"key":"e_1_3_4_26_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1007\/BF02294188"},{"key":"e_1_3_4_27_1","unstructured":"Mebane Jr WR (2006) Election forensics: Vote counts and Benford\u2019s law. In Summer Meeting of the Political Methodology Society UC-Davis July. Vol. 17. https:\/\/websites.umich.edu\/~wmebane\/pm06.pdf"},{"key":"e_1_3_4_28_1","unstructured":"Mebane Jr WR (2008) Election forensics: Outlier and digit tests in America and Russia. In American Electoral Process conference. Princeton NJ: Center for the Study of Democratic Politics Princeton University. https:\/\/websites.umich.edu\/~wmebane\/aep2008.pdf"},{"key":"e_1_3_4_29_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1080\/09332480.2010.10739785"},{"key":"e_1_3_4_30_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1093\/pan\/mpr024"},{"key":"e_1_3_4_31_1","unstructured":"Mebane Jr WR (2012) Second-digit tests for voters\u2019 election strategies and election fraud. In Annual Meeting of the Midwest Po